        <div class="tn-head tn-head--split" data-reveal="up">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow"><Fragment set:html={leaf} />Tin box types</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Nine Types of Custom Tin Boxes</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="tn-head-sub">The shape, the lid and the lining are set by what goes inside the tin. Name a fill and a run size, and the card becomes a line on a quote.</p>
        </div>
